      "content": "the walls are shaking again. i can't even remember the last time i had a full meal... everything just feels so heavy and empty at the same time. i can hear them out there, just waiting for us to break. i don't think i have anything left in me to fight for. it's just going to be so much worse when they finally get through, isn't it?",
